    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI sales lead qualification system.\n\nYour job is to analyze incoming business leads and determine how valuable and urgent each lead is.\n\nAnalyze the following information:\n\n* Company\n* Industry\n* Business requirement\n* Budget\n* Timeline\n\nCalculate a lead score from 0 to 100.\n\nConsider these factors:\n\n1. Budget\n2. Urgency\n3. Specificity of the requirement\n4. Buying intent\n5. Business potential\n\nClassify the lead as:\n\nHOT = strong buying intent, meaningful budget and urgent/specific requirement.\n\nWARM = genuine interest but moderate budget, urgency or buying intent.\n\nCOLD = weak buying intent, low budget, vague requirement or no clear timeline.\n\nBuying intent must be one of:\n\nHIGH\nMEDIUM\nLOW\n\nRecommended action should be a short practical action for the sales team.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n\"lead_id\":\"\",\n\"lead_score\": 0,\n\"lead_temperature\": \"HOT\",\n\"buying_intent\": \"HIGH\",\n\"recommended_action\": \"Contact within 1 hour\"\n}\n\nDo not invent information that is not present in the lead.\n\nLead ID:\n{{ $json.lead_id }}\n\nName:\n{{ $json.name }}\n\nCompany:\n{{ $json.company }}\n\nIndustry:\n{{ $json.industry }}\n\nRequirement:\n{{ $json.requirement }}\n\nBudget:\n{{ $json.budget }}\n\nTimeline:\n{{ $json.timeline }}\n\n",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
