      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a professional sales communication assistant.\n\nWrite a short, natural and personalized email to a high-intent business lead.\n\nThe email must:\n\n* Address the person by name\n* Mention their specific requirement\n* Show that we understand their business need\n* Suggest a short discussion or call\n* Be professional and human\n* Be concise\n\nDo not invent pricing, discounts, guarantees, features or timelines.\n\nLead:\n\nName: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.name }}\n\n\nCompany: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.company }}\n\nIndustry: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.industry }}\n\nRequirement: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.requirement }}\n\nBudget: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.budget }}\n\nTimeline: {{ $('Google Sheets Trigger').item.json.timeline }}\n\nWrite ONLY the email body.\n",
